# Modernize and Compact Profile Page

Redesign the profile page to be more efficient, visually appealing, and compact by using a tabbed two-column layout.

## Proposed Changes

### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [profile.html](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/profile.html)
- **Layout Change**: Implement a two-column layout with a vertical navigation sidebar on the left and a content area on the right.
- **Tab System**: Group settings into "Personal Information", "Professional Details", and "Security".
- **Compact Styling**: 
    - Reduce whitespace and margin in cards.
    - Use glassmorphism and subtle borders.
    - Modernize the "Danger Zone" with a more refined alert style.
- **Enhanced Header**: Create a profile "Hero" section with a large avatar and key user info.

